[128.9498, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231mod, wrapping) do not matter.\"                                                      \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m6\u001b[17G\u001b[38;5;231myes: \"The me\u001b[30Gsage summarises what w\u001b[53Gs changed\u001b[63Gand\u001b[67Galso gives the reason for t\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bhe change. A r\u001b[26Gference to the issue or pull request the change belongs \u001b[83Go (for exam\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bple an issu\u001b[24Gnumber or PR\u001b[38Gumber) counts as the reason.\u001b[67GForma\u001b[73Gting and style (lengt\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bh, capitalisati\u001b[27Gn, mood, w\u001b[38Gapping)\u001b[46Gdo\u001b[49Gnot\u001b[53Gmatter.\"\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 15 +\u001b[38;5;231m      \u001b[38;5;148mno:\u001b[38;5;231m \u001b[38;5;186m\"Nothing in the message, stated or implied, gives a reason for the change\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;186m and there is no issue or pull request reference\"\u001b[38;5;231m                                  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 16 +\u001b[38;5;231m      \u001b[38;5;148myes:\u001b[38;5;231m \u001b[38;5;186m\"The message gives a reason, in any one of these ways: describes the iss\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;186mue (error scenario, shortcoming, issue report); states the objective or goal; illus\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;186mtrates a requirement (something out of date, environment changed, a usage need); im\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bplies n\u001b[19Gc\u001b[21Gssity (follows a convention,\u001b[50Gbrings an improvement or benefit, relates to\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;186m an implemented feature or prior commit); or references the issue or pull request t\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bh\u001b[14Gchange\u001b[21Gbelongs to\"\u001b[38;5;231m                                                              \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 17 \u001b[22m   - \u001b[38;5;148mid:\u001b[38;5;231m \u001b[38;5;186mwhat\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 18 \u001b[22m     \u001b[38;5;148mname:\u001b[38;5;231m \u001b[38;5;186mSays\u001b[38;5;231m \u001b[38;5;186mwhat\u001b[38;5;231m \u001b[38;5;186mchanged\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 19 \u001b[22m     \u001b[38;5;148minputs:\u001b[38;5;231m [\u001b[38;5;186mmessage\u001b[38;5;231m]\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mCalled verdict \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mOverall agreement is at 75% after\u001b[37Ga\u001b[39G3-point\u001b[47Gdrop,\u001b[53Geven\u001b[58Gthough\u001b[65G\u001b[38;5;153mwhy\u001b[69G\u001b[39malone\u001b[75Greached\u001b[83G81%,\u001b[88Gand\u001b[92Gseveral\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmisses\u001b[10Gcome\u001b[15Gfrom\u001b[20G\u001b[38;5;153mwhat\u001b[25G\u001b[39mratings\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Gjudge\u001b[43Gis\u001b[46Gnearly\u001b[53Gguessing\u001b[62Gon.\u001b[66GI'm\u001b[70Gsetting\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gjudge\u001b[88Gto\u001b[91Ghand\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gvery-low-confidence\u001b[23Gratings\u001b[31Gto\u001b[34Ga\u001b[36Ghuman\u001b[42Gwith\u001b[47G\u001b[38;5;153mminConfidence: 0.1\u001b[39m,\u001b[67Gcapped\u001b[74Gat\u001b[77G12.\r\u001b[27C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246m7\u001b[30G1\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
